			"notes": "* You can now **set your home/bed locations** so that it can recommend you do `/home` or `/home bed` if that leads to a faster route. Set them using the config menu or the `/nr config` command. I might make a video tutorial in the coming days.\n* `/nr stationlist` can no longer be used for ŋationless (X__) codes, since that behaviour was a bug anyway.\n* Codes in the network.json file are normalised to uppercase (hopefully implemented correctly).\n* Now automatically generates \"___ Nether\" names for Nether stations without names that have corresponding overworld stations with names.\n* It should no longer suggest routes that start on the opposite side of the Nether ceiling."
